// Parameter: DataFolder
// Home > Manage Parameters > New parameter
//   Name: DataFolder   Type: Text   Current value: the export folder WITH a trailing backslash, e.g.
//   C:\hr-attendance-analytics\output\powerbi\
// Every other query reads its CSV from this folder, so moving the files only needs this value changed.
"C:\hr-attendance-analytics\output\powerbi\" meta [IsParameterQuery = true, Type = "Text", IsParameterQueryRequired = true]
